  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: escalado (regular)",
    "*Escalar una montaña* = to climb a mountain: *Escalaron el Everest sin oxígeno* = They climbed Everest without oxygen",
    "*Escalar en roca* = to go rock climbing",
    "Also used figuratively: *escalar posiciones* = to climb the ranks, *escalar un conflicto* = to escalate a conflict",
    "Related: la escalada (climbing; escalation), el/la escalador/a (climber), escalar posiciones (to climb the ranks)"
